<title>SINGAPORE: Singapura Building Soc 1st-half net up.</title>
<headline>Singapura Building Soc 1st-half net up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				3.74 vs   3.08</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     7.33 vs   6.22</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)   6.37 vs   5.33</p>
<p>    Turnover				 12.55 vs  10.97</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.21 vs   0.21</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    4.46 vs   3.66</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	   0.11 vs   0.10</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  5.05 vs   4.22</p>
<p>    Tax					 1.32 vs   1.14</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Singapura Building Society Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
